# Copy to `.dev.vars` (gitignored) to make the local debug panel show REAL
# Cloudflare usage figures instead of "no credentials". Entirely optional —
# without it the panel still opens and still shows every free-tier limit, it
# just cannot fill in the "used" half of each bar.
#
# `wrangler dev` reads `.dev.vars` automatically. Nothing else in the app
# looks at either value, and neither leaves the Worker.
#
# Mint the token at https://dash.cloudflare.com/profile/api-tokens
#   Create Token -> Create Custom Token
#   Permissions:  Account | Account Analytics | Read
# That single permission is all /debug/usage needs. Do NOT reuse the deploy
# token from HOSTING.md — that one can edit Workers, and this one only has to
# read numbers.
CF_API_TOKEN=your-account-analytics-read-token

# Workers & Pages overview, right-hand sidebar. Same value as the
# CLOUDFLARE_ACCOUNT_ID used for deploys.
CF_ACCOUNT_ID=your-account-id
